TWO SWEET little moments captured a heartwarming evening in Sydney on Saturday s twomodern ODI masters synced together in a jugalbandi to remember. The first came right when Virat Kohli clenched his fist with a smile after getting his first run after two ducks in the previous games. It was a lighthearted gesture, not an angsty relief, that said much about his relaxed state of mind. The second was right at the

